@host = http://localhost:5245
@email = {{$processEnv EXPENSEHUB_EMPLOYEE_EMAIL}}
@password = {{$processEnv EXPENSEHUB_EMPLOYEE_PASSWORD}}
@reportId = replace-with-id-from-create-response

### Faça login após atribuir Employee (ou Auditor para Global).
# @name reportLogin
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Solicitar (sem ownerId no corpo)
# @name createReport
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromDate":"2026-09-01","toDate":"2026-09-30","scope":"Mine"}

### Listar somente próprias
GET {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Acompanhar o MESMO id
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{createReport.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Download Excel (salve a resposta como .xlsx)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{createReport.response.body.id}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Employee não pode Global (403)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromDate":"2026-09-01","toDate":"2026-09-30","scope":"Global"}

### Período inválido (400)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromDate":"2026-09-30","toDate":"2026-09-01","scope":"Mine"}

### Anônimo (401)
GET {{host}}/api/reports

### Id alheio/inexistente (404); substitua reportId por id criado por outro usuário
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Excel alheio (404)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{reportLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
